      "inconsistency_hints": [
        "The main flow only activates command control and records that the Operator acquires it; it does not establish that the system can execute stored operational control command sequences based on mode and schedule, which is an excluded adjacent scheduled-operations outcome.",
        "Trigger says the Operator requests command control 'via the logon screen', but Preconditions state the Operator is already logged on. This makes the trigger start from an upstream logon step that the preconditions explicitly contradict (and the goal scope excludes as an entry step), so the trigger is not aligned with the precondition state.",
        "Postcondition 4 states that if another user previously had command control, that user is notified when the new Operator takes control. The Main Flow has no step that notifies or otherwise handles a previous controller, so this postcondition is not reached by the described flow."
      ]
    }
  ],
